WEBVTT

00:08:56.907 --> 00:09:00.542
kvadriplegičara.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.108
Ja ne verujem.

00:09:04.108 --> 00:09:06.694
U svom umu

00:09:06.694 --> 00:09:09.456
i svojim snovima

00:09:09.456 --> 00:09:12.296
svake noći

00:09:12.296 --> 00:09:17.211
ja Šigal-čovek lebdim

00:09:17.211 --> 00:09:20.339
iznad grada,

00:09:20.339 --> 00:09:23.556
vitlam i kovitlam

00:09:23.556 --> 00:09:27.812
i stopalima ljubim tlo.